flowchart TD
  Interrupted[Interrupted boundary] --> State[Read revisioned session state]
  State --> Candidate{Candidate MP3 and validation sidecar exist?}
  Candidate -->|yes| RecoverCandidate[Recover manifest/evidence without rerender]
  Candidate -->|no| Finalization{Finalization journal incomplete?}
  Finalization -->|yes| Reconcile[Classify finalization_incomplete]
  Finalization -->|no| Legacy[Classify legacy/output/candidate recovery state]
  RecoverCandidate --> Review[Resume technical or manual review]
  Reconcile --> Preserve[Preserve artifacts; never auto-delete]
  Legacy --> Preserve
